[{"title":"Cloud Mattress Topper","handle":"cloud-topper","descriptionHtml":"<p>Your bed, made new. 10cm of plump, even softness that adds comfort and support without replacing your mattress.</p><ul><li>10cm deep, quilted so the fill stays even</li><li>1100–1200 GSM microfibre fill, depending on size</li><li>Breathable and hypoallergenic</li><li>Secure, non-slip fit</li><li>Machine washable</li></ul><h3>Description</h3><p>A quilted microfibre topper that sits on your mattress and adds 10cm of soft, even comfort. The cushioning adapts to your body shape, helping keep your spine aligned and reducing movement disturbance through the night.</p><p>Breathable materials let air move freely, so heat doesn’t build up while you sleep. It’s ideal for a firm or tired mattress — it restores comfort and helps your mattress last longer.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><table><tbody><tr><th>Depth</th><td>10cm</td></tr><tr><th>Fill</th><td>Microfibre, 1100–1200 GSM by size</td></tr><tr><th>Fabric</th><td>100% microfibre</td></tr><tr><th>Fit</th><td>Secure, non-slip</td></tr><tr><th>Colour</th><td>White</td></tr><tr><th>SKU</th><td>LGT12</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Size guide</h3><table><tbody><tr><th>Single</th><td>90 × 190cm</td></tr><tr><th>4ft</th><td>Small double</td></tr><tr><th>Double</th><td>137 × 190cm</td></tr><tr><th>Super King</th><td>182 × 200cm</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Care</h3><ul><li>Machine washable.</li><li>Follow the care label for wash temperature and drying.</li></ul>","vendor":"Elovela","productType":"Cloud Topper","tags":["cloud-toppers"],"status":"ACTIVE","productOptions":[{"name":"Size","position":1,"values":[{"name":"Single"},{"name":"4ft"},{"name":"Double"},{"name":"King"},{"name":"Super King"}]}],"variants":[{"optionValues":[{"optionName":"Size","name":"Single"}],"price":"20.64","position":1,"inventoryPolicy":"DENY","taxable":true,"inventoryItem":{"tracked":false,"requiresShipping":true}},{"optionValues":[{"optionName":"Size","name":"4ft"}],"price":"22.89",